<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-58ce799a56a0d3e2d0432019f1551eb0ded38b6d186dc07cf972b700dcc00b8a">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/14/a55/040" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">14A.55.040  Administrative Review.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>A person, who is issued a notice of violation, may challenge the findings in the notice by requesting an administrative review from the Portland Permitting &amp; Development.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-ba5a2d339026e37e4492b8af3489dc2aa9a21a6fc635226c6560306077390442">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
