<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/14/a55/060" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">14A.55.060  Further Appeals.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>All appeals from the Code Hearings Officer's determination pursuant to Section &nbsp;14A.55.050 of this Code will be by writ of review as authorized by Portland City Code Section 22.04.010 and ORS 34.010 - 34.100.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
